  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "why do i always leave one spare slot?",
      "optimism",
      "for a rare drop?",
      "or the thing you forgot to pack"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "my bank has more plans than items",
      "mine has items with no plans",
      "between us we might be organised",
      "lets not risk it",
      "we could make a list",
      "i would bank the list and lose it",
      "right, lets start with one item",
      "now thats manageable"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "anything exciting planned?",
      "a quiet training trip",
      "sounds good honestly",
      "sometimes thats exactly what you need"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you know what i like about gathering skills?",
      "what?",
      "you come back with something useful",
      "and usually a story about forgetting a tool"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "one day ill have everything ready before i leave",
      "dont set impossible goals",
      "bit harsh",
      "im speaking from experience"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "how do you choose an outfit?",
      "start with the boots",
      "then what?",
      "usually realise none of it matches"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im taking a quick break",
      "good idea",
      "dont let me start another grind yet",
      "ill try, no promises"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you ever remember an item by the place you lost it?",
      "unfortunately yes",
      "thats an expensive landmark",
      "very memorable though"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "keeping your old armour?",
      "might need a spare set",
      "reasonable",
      "also i cant quite bring myself to sell it"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "need to decide what to do next",
      "what sounds fun?",
      "thats allowed?",
      "i checked, seems to be"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "got any goals for today?",
      "use some of the stuff in my bank",
      "which stuff?",
      "the part thats been waiting longest"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "why does the last inventory always take longer?",
      "because you keep checking it",
      "you might be right",
      "try a conversation instead"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you dont need perfect gear to get started",
      "just the right supplies",
      "and a bit of patience",
      "both tend to run out together"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "ill let you get back to it",
      "cheers for the chat",
      "good luck with the levels",
      "you too"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "catch you after the next bank trip?",
      "probably",
      "ill try to remember what i went for",
      "thats a fine goal, see you soon"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "sometimes the cheap upgrade is the useful one",
      "leaves coins for the rest of the setup",
      "exactly",
      "the fancy one can wait"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "what are you collecting at the moment?",
      "materials for later training",
      "thats a broad answer",
      "my bank is a broad problem",
      "i keep thinking the next skill will use it all",
      "sometimes it actually does",
      "then i have to gather more",
      "the bank gets hungry either way",
      "at least nothing sits there forever",
      "just until the next training plan",
      "good luck with the current one",
      "cheers, one stack at a time"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "do you ever bring too much food?",
      "better than bringing none",
      "true",
      "the backpack disagrees though"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "getting a level while talking is nice",
      "surprise grats",
      "best kind",
      "hope you get one soon too"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "whats the plan after this?",
      "bank, then probably another trip",
      "same route again?",
      "different day, same forgotten item"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you got a favourite town?",
      "depends which bank has my stuff",
      "they all do",
      "then im very well travelled"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "this started as a quick visit",
      "thats how the good chats happen",
      "i really should go train",
      "good luck when you do"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "whats in that spare bank slot?",
      "room for ambition",
      "mine is full of feathers",
      "also ambition, just a different shape"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you ever finish a goal then forget to stop?",
      "one more trip for luck",
      "and one more after that",
      "luck takes a lot of supplies"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im trying to keep things simple today",
      "pick a skill and stick with it",
      "thats the plan",
      "good luck, enjoy it"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "did that level take long?",
      "long enough that i noticed",
      "grats anyway",
      "thanks, worth it in the end"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you need anything before you head off?",
      "just to remember why i came back",
      "take your time",
      "there it is, forgot the food"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "lets call that a decent bit of progress",
      "even if it was mostly talking?",
      "especially then",
      "fair enough, enjoyed the company"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "thinking of saving for a rune scimitar",
      "solid melee upgrade",
      "ill check supplies before spending the lot",
      "good, the sword wont buy your food"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "which amulet would you pick for general training?",
      "depends what youre doing",
      "mostly want something useful that i can afford",
      "compare the bonuses before buying"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "nice thing about a strength amulet is the name is honest",
      "doesnt promise to organise your bank",
      "none of my gear helps with that",
      "a sadly neglected bonus"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "should i sell my spare mithril armour?",
      "keep a usable set if youll need it",
      "and sell the extra pieces?",
      "only after checking what youre actually wearing"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "ive been comparing power and strength amulets",
      "different bonuses for different plans",
      "yeah, not just picking the shiny one",
      "very advanced shopping technique"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "do matching gloves and boots matter?",
      "for the outfit, absolutely",
      "what about training?",
      "check the actual bonuses too"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "a cheap cape can finish an outfit",
      "and leave enough coins for the trip",
      "thats the real benefit",
      "fashion on a supply budget"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im keeping a spare weapon banked",
      "handy if a trip goes badly",
      "hope i dont need it",
      "nice to know its there"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "thinking of changing from melee to ranged for a while",
      "check your arrows before leaving",
      "and my bow?",
      "that would also be helpful"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "range supplies always seem to run out together",
      "then its a trip back for more",
      "at least arrows stack",
      "not like packing another set of armour"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "i want to try a bit more magic training",
      "got the runes sorted?",
      "thats the first job",
      "check the spell requirements before buying a mountain"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "do you keep every rune you pick up?",
      "most of them",
      "even the little piles?",
      "small piles become useful stacks"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "nature runes have a habit of becoming training plans",
      "alchemy or runecrafting plans?",
      "either, depending on the bank",
      "nice to have choices"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you can tell i need supplies by how long i spend at the bank",
      "what are you short of?",
      "usually whichever rune i forgot to check",
      "classic inventory planning"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im thinking of fishing lobsters later",
      "take a lobster pot",
      "thats exactly what i would have forgotten",
      "glad we had this chat then"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "trout and salmon are useful early food",
      "and a good reason to train cooking",
      "two skills from one trip",
      "quite a nice little loop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "would you keep swordfish or sell them?",
      "depends how much food you need",
      "probably keep a reserve then",
      "yeah, leave yourself supplies for a trip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "sharks always make me think of long fishing sessions",
      "and hungry fighters",
      "everyone has their part to play",
      "the fish may disagree"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "woodcutting first or fletching first?",
      "hard to fletch without logs",
      "right, tools before ambition",
      "a reliable starting point"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "willow logs can become quite a bank stack",
      "one trip never looks like much",
      "then suddenly youve got a project",
      "thats how most of my plans start"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im saving yew logs until i choose what to do with them",
      "nice materials to have ready",
      "just need to commit to a plan",
      "your bank will wait, apparently forever"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "thinking about a firemaking session",
      "got logs and a tinderbox?",
      "the tinderbox is the part i always forget",
      "cheap tool, expensive walk back"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "coal looks simple until you decide to smith with it",
      "then the other supplies matter",
      "exactly, trying to check the whole recipe",
      "saves discovering the problem at the furnace"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "ive been keeping my iron ore",
      "planning a smithing session?",
      "maybe, otherwise i can trade the supplies",
      "good to have an option"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "smithing makes the ore pile feel more useful",
      "long way from rock to equipment",
      "and plenty of bank visits between",
      "part of the craftsmanship"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you can never find bowstrings when you finally want them",
      "check the flax you banked",
      "then i have another skill to do first",
      "the supplies have made your schedule"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im saving feathers instead of dropping them",
      "fishing or fletching later?",
      "either, theyre handy",
      "good use for a little stack"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "leather supplies have been waiting in my bank",
      "thinking about crafting?",
      "yeah, need to check what i can actually make",
      "tools and requirements first then"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "gems are a good reason to check the crafting level",
      "and the right supplies",
      "i always remember the gem and forget the tool",
      "a very sparkly banking mistake"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im keeping bones for prayer training",
      "small piles add up",
      "another use for a spare bank space",
      "better than forgetting why its empty"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "runecrafting is making me look at essence differently",
      "every trip starts with supplies",
      "and remembering the route",
      "two important parts of the skill"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "selling the materials or the finished items?",
      "ill compare before choosing",
      "good idea, prices can move",
      "no point guessing from an old offer"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "what do you do when an offer seems too good?",
      "check both sides of the trade",
      "and the quantities?",
      "every time, no rush"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "i try to agree on a price before opening the trade",
      "saves confusion later",
      "then check it again in the window",
      "sensible habit"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "coins go quickly when you buy a whole training session",
      "start with a small batch",
      "check whether i even like the skill?",
      "exactly, cheaper way to find out"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "would you trade spare logs for supplies you need?",
      "if the terms make sense",
      "nice when both people get useful things",
      "just check what is actually being offered"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "the busiest trade shout isnt always the best price",
      "worth looking at more than one offer",
      "and knowing what youre buying",
      "helps with most shopping"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im not buying anything just because somebody shouts cheap",
      "very sensible",
      "my bank already has enough bargains i never use",
      "then its learning from experience"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you can ask a price without committing to a trade",
      "thats a relief",
      "just be clear youre comparing",
      "good point, no need to waste anyones time"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "what would you save from a messy bank clearout?",
      "tools and things i actually use",
      "thats a good place to start",
      "sell the uncertainty last"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "slayer trip after this?",
      "maybe, need to check my assignment first",
      "then choose food and gear for it",
      "yeah, better than packing at random"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "agility sounds like a change of pace",
      "more moving about than bankstanding",
      "thats what i was thinking",
      "remember to actually leave the bank then"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "thinking of a quiet farming visit later",
      "check your seeds and tools",
      "another list to remember",
      "a small list is cheaper than a second trip"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "thieving always makes me think about food supplies",
      "good idea to be prepared",
      "rather bank before i need it",
      "sensible way to start a session"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "after this i might train a different combat style",
      "nice to use some of the spare gear",
      "just need the right setup",
      "and enough supplies to stay a while"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "fishing supplies are cheaper when i remember what i own",
      "check the bank before shopping?",
      "trying to learn that",
      "saves buying another identical tool"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "theres a lot to do with a little pile of logs",
      "cut, burn, fletch, bank them forever",
      "im very experienced at the last one",
      "excellent, time to try one of the others"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "my next gear upgrade is whichever empty slot needs it",
      "gloves or boots maybe?",
      "yeah, little improvements count",
      "and usually leave money for the rest"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "im keeping a little food in reserve",
      "for an unplanned trip?",
      "or a badly planned one",
      "good thinking, those are common"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "IDLE"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "all my trading plans end with buying more supplies",
      "thats what the coins are for",
      "true, might as well put them to use",
      "leave enough for the next trip home"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "this is a good spot for doing absolutely nothing",
      "call it recovering from training",
      "much better name",
      "very important recovery work"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "fountain is a decent meeting point",
      "hard to mistake it for the bank",
      "ive managed worse",
      "then we will stand somewhere obvious",
      "do your friends ever turn up at the wrong one?",
      "usually its me in the wrong place",
      "at least youve found this one",
      "im going to stay put and enjoy that"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "castle looks bigger when youre just standing here",
      "plenty of room for someone else to be important"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "going anywhere or just hanging around?",
      "just taking a break",
      "same here",
      "good spot for it"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "everyone ends up back in varrock eventually",
      "banks, shops, people to talk to",
      "and this fountain",
      "the full training schedule"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "i came here to sort my inventory",
      "and now youre talking instead",
      "i consider this progress",
      "social progress counts"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "leave a little room for people coming through",
      "yeah, no need to stand in the doorway",
      "we can talk over here",
      "much better"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "did you see that outfit?",
      "hard to miss those colours"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "fountain side or castle side?",
      "depends where the company is",
      "good answer",
      "the view doesnt complain either way",
      "i might wander over there later",
      "leave the main path open when you do",
      "yeah, plenty of space beside it",
      "catch you over there then"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "the town feels busy today",
      "nice having people about",
      "even if half of us are resting",
      "resting is serious business",
      "the alchers are still working though",
      "they picked a good place for it",
      "casts and conversation",
      "very balanced training"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you waiting for someone?",
      "mostly waiting for motivation",
      "tell me if you see any",
      "ill save you some"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "we have picked a very scenic place to waste time",
      "waste is a harsh word"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "how long were you going to stay here?",
      "a minute",
      "and now?",
      "i have stopped counting"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "the alching makes quite a background noise",
      "better than listening to my own training plans",
      "any good plans?",
      "ask after the next flash"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you heading through the castle?",
      "just standing nearby for now",
      "fair, plenty going on out here",
      "and i dont have to find my way back out"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "this corner has good people watching",
      "you mean outfit watching",
      "mostly",
      "some impressive hats out today"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "thought id stop by before training",
      "thats what i said too",
      "how long ago?",
      "lets not ruin a nice afternoon"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "you can always find someone near the fountain",
      "handy when you forget a name",
      "meet me by the water works",
      "unless they go fishing"
    ]
  },
  {
    "topics": [
      "HOME"
    ],
    "lines": [
      "anyone else here taking a bank break?",
      "my bank is taking a break from me",
      "too many visits?",
